				MX6UL_PAD_NAND_DATA01__USDHC2_DATA1 0x170f9
				MX6UL_PAD_NAND_DATA02__USDHC2_DATA2 0x170f9
				MX6UL_PAD_NAND_DATA03__USDHC2_DATA3 0x170f9
